{{!
    @template mod_aibranchedscenario/artefact

    A document off the wall of the workplace: a permit, a data sheet, a checklist, an email.

    Structured text rather than a generated picture, deliberately. A photograph of a permit
    is unreadable at phone width, invisible to a screen reader, untranslatable, and comes
    back from an image model with invented words on it. This reflows, it is real text, it
    costs nothing, and a wrong line can be corrected without regenerating anything.

    The flagged marker is NOT drawn as a warning here. Pointing at the wrong line on the
    decision screen would be answering the question the document exists to ask. It is
    carried through so the debrief can name the line afterwards, which is the moment naming
    it teaches anybody anything.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * kind string permit, sds, checklist, email, sign, record or document
    * kindlabel string That kind in words
    * title string The document heading
    * subtitle string A reference line under it, or empty
    * fields array [{label, value, flagged}]
    * hasfields bool Whether there are any
    * lines array [{text}]
    * haslines bool Whether there are any
    * footer string A signature line, or empty

    Example context (json):
    {
        "kind": "permit",
        "kindlabel": "Permit to work",
        "title": "Hot work permit",
        "subtitle": "HW-4471 - Bay 3",
        "fields": [
            {"label": "Valid until", "value": "14:00, 3 March", "flagged": true},
            {"label": "Issued by", "value": "R. Mills, Maintenance", "flagged": false}
        ],
        "hasfields": true,
        "lines": [],
        "haslines": false,
        "footer": "Return to the permit board on completion."
    }
}}
<figure class="aibs-artefact aibs-artefact-{{kind}}">
    <figcaption class="aibs-artefact-kind">{{kindlabel}}</figcaption>
    <div class="aibs-artefact-sheet">
        <div class="aibs-artefact-head">
            <p class="aibs-artefact-title">{{title}}</p>
            {{#subtitle}}<p class="aibs-artefact-sub">{{subtitle}}</p>{{/subtitle}}
        </div>

        {{#hasfields}}
            <dl class="aibs-artefact-fields">
                {{#fields}}
                    <div class="aibs-artefact-row">
                        <dt class="aibs-artefact-label">{{label}}</dt>
                        <dd class="aibs-artefact-value">{{value}}</dd>
                    </div>
                {{/fields}}
            </dl>
        {{/hasfields}}

        {{#haslines}}
            <ul class="aibs-artefact-lines">
                {{#lines}}<li class="aibs-artefact-line">{{text}}</li>{{/lines}}
            </ul>
        {{/haslines}}

        {{#footer}}<p class="aibs-artefact-footer">{{footer}}</p>{{/footer}}
    </div>
</figure>
